{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/Balladrion1.gif?t=1751457106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a quiet city with no memory. There\u2019s no guidance \u2014 only portals leading to dangerous lands. Fight enemies, choose from random skills, gather loot, mine resources, and uncover the world of Balladrion piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run offers different upgrades, time-limited events, and unexpected challenges. Silent visions from a mysterious being guide you forward, revealing fragments of your past and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Balladrion is a humble indie project focused on replayable gameplay and a small, yet meaningful story with an interesting ending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756740/extras/Balladrion2.gif?t=1751457106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue-lite third-person action</strong> with elements of randomness and replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mining, crafting, and upgrading</strong> your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random skills and upgrades</strong> each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A stylized magical world</strong> full of enemies, loot, and evolving paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short timed events(Lucky minute) with random effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short visual story fragments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entirely <strong>developed by a solo indie developer</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756740?t=17